        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "49f95d89-ec04-3291-a2fc-07f68a72c3de",
                "word": "attrait",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "c81bbb86-2951-4928-a457-c8f9777120f3",
                        "entry_id": "49f95d89-ec04-3291-a2fc-07f68a72c3de",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "attraits"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3382b584-0efd-332c-bf34-dab7ce1bf9e7",
                        "entry_id": "49f95d89-ec04-3291-a2fc-07f68a72c3de",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Ce qui attire agréablement ; ou inclination, goût que l’on a pour quelque chose d’agréable."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "bdc94b8e-117f-43b2-883a-2de84ba5ab94",
                                "sense_id": "3382b584-0efd-332c-bf34-dab7ce1bf9e7",
                                "text": "Un enfant, […], a incontestablement un droit naturel à la subsistance, fondé sur le devoir prescrit par la nature au pere et à la mere. Ce droit lui est d’autant plus assuré que le devoir du pere et de la mere est accompagné d’un attrait naturel, qui agit beaucoup plus puissamment sur le pere et plus particulierement sur la mere, que le motif du précepte qui établit le devoir."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ecdd4fba-075d-43da-90aa-2ffde501915e",
                                "sense_id": "3382b584-0efd-332c-bf34-dab7ce1bf9e7",
                                "text": "Aux aventureux, l'Islande offre aussi l’attrait de l’inconnu. Le cœur de l’île, inhabité et inhabitable, est encore une terre incognito."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "17db7007-b068-4fff-9c32-d8d6c54428d0",
                                "sense_id": "3382b584-0efd-332c-bf34-dab7ce1bf9e7",
                                "text": "Non content de déblatérer sur la couille molle que je suis […], il m'accuse de plus de l'intrusion d'une crapule dans mon foyer, ainsi que de son attrait pour une queutarde patentée."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "07b0eb81-be90-4aed-b2b9-a0a8ad3b44ca",
                                "sense_id": "3382b584-0efd-332c-bf34-dab7ce1bf9e7",
                                "text": "L’involucre, cette collerette de bractées finement découpées qui entourent l’inflorescence chez certaines espèces, chez les ombellifères en particulier, ne constitue jamais, comme chez la nigelle de Damas, l’attrait principal de la plante."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a733a2d0-1f75-3cb5-a590-67e6d7fbe175",
                        "entry_id": "49f95d89-ec04-3291-a2fc-07f68a72c3de",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Agréments, charmes d’une personne."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "especially",
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "08468fb1-f642-4486-84f5-51cca1ec27f8",
                                "sense_id": "a733a2d0-1f75-3cb5-a590-67e6d7fbe175",
                                "text": "Et s’il parlait aux demoiselles : « Que le ciel, disait-il, vous donne un époux vraiment digne de vos attraits et de vos vertus. »"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c95720ce-7a73-42af-86bb-44c95c74e13f",
                                "sense_id": "a733a2d0-1f75-3cb5-a590-67e6d7fbe175",
                                "text": "…, et les plus jeunes chevaliers, se regardant les uns les autres, se dirent, dans le langage muet des yeux, que ses attraits étaient le meilleur sortilège qu’elle eût pu employer pour gagner le cœur de Bois-Guilbert."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "da20b4be-addb-4205-97d8-4e901e6255e7",
                                "sense_id": "a733a2d0-1f75-3cb5-a590-67e6d7fbe175",
                                "text": "Sa froideur a, pour moi, tant d’attraits, qu’elle me brûle et me glace. J'ai beau savoir qu'au fond de ce regard, tout est calcul et complaisance, où qu'il m'entraîne, je le suivrai."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "fd426c09-2592-4202-a694-1a93d6ea32ce",
                        "source_entry_id": "49f95d89-ec04-3291-a2fc-07f68a72c3de",
                        "target_lang_word": "attraction",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "attraction",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2f0fc83a-292a-3a97-b298-b9ecc69ec076",
                                        "entry_id": "23f07461-bb0e-38d1-87ba-5898ddb9671a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The tendency to attract."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fdc504c1-3d8a-48c9-b97f-2d1bbf272678",
                                                "sense_id": "2f0fc83a-292a-3a97-b298-b9ecc69ec076",
                                                "text": "The Moon is held in its orbit by the attraction of the Earth's gravity."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2efb46d3-2b28-3f17-9fd9-78d89d196422",
                                        "entry_id": "23f07461-bb0e-38d1-87ba-5898ddb9671a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The feeling of being attracted (to something)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "588b7682-6480-43a2-adbf-da74afb2d9da",
                                                "sense_id": "2efb46d3-2b28-3f17-9fd9-78d89d196422",
                                                "text": "I felt a strange attraction towards the place."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a1051571-6d38-40b7-a821-f180473663a4",
                                                "sense_id": "2efb46d3-2b28-3f17-9fd9-78d89d196422",
                                                "text": "When you're well enough off so's you don't have to fret about anything but your heft or your diseases you begin to get queer, I suppose. And the queerer the cure for those ailings the bigger the attraction. A place like the Right Livers' Rest was bound to draw freaks, same as molasses draws flies."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e175e395-d2df-3521-ab11-a64e69676fd7",
                                        "entry_id": "23f07461-bb0e-38d1-87ba-5898ddb9671a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The feeling of being attracted (to something).",
                                            "Sexual or romantic desire (especially for a specified individual, kind of person, etc)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "24007ca8-7d4d-441a-86b1-9ec7d3f215e3",
                                                "sense_id": "e175e395-d2df-3521-ab11-a64e69676fd7",
                                                "text": "Murphy struggled with his attraction to men while remaining happily married all his life, daily negotiating the challenges of living in two locations simultaneously. These doublings of desire and emotional attachment left their trace in the multiple doublings within […] the billboard painting he made to signpost the home he created with his wife Sara […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d3efdcbc-3366-4f89-b4d3-712270a72d87",
                                                "sense_id": "e175e395-d2df-3521-ab11-a64e69676fd7",
                                                "text": "\"I'm asexual,\" Yazhiisai said, the words spilling out faster than she intended. \"I don't experience attraction the way most people do. I'm telling you this because I don't want there to be any surprises.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a002d985-dfac-3ff5-9c6c-096c242b4d75",
                                        "entry_id": "23f07461-bb0e-38d1-87ba-5898ddb9671a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An event, location, or business that has a tendency to draw interest from visitors, and in many cases, local residents."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8a6df023-eabe-4a38-a40b-3d78e5f92c6f",
                                                "sense_id": "a002d985-dfac-3ff5-9c6c-096c242b4d75",
                                                "text": "The new mall should be a major attraction."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "27fde16d-a88c-439d-8e21-eeced8e7242c",
                                                "sense_id": "a002d985-dfac-3ff5-9c6c-096c242b4d75",
                                                "text": "Star Tours is a very cool Disney World attraction."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2e4d7aac-c396-3fdc-a5ed-28be48bad1a2",
                                        "entry_id": "23f07461-bb0e-38d1-87ba-5898ddb9671a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The sacrifice of pieces in order to expose the enemy king."
                                        ],
